  "text": "Làm đềtrực tuyến tại: https://ielts-fighter.com/online-test.html\nWebsite tựhọc IELTS: https://ielts-fighter.com\n2. Do you have the same personal qualities as your parents? [Why/Why\nnot?]\n3. What personal qualities are important to you in a friend? [Why?]\n4. Do you think you have the personal qualities to be a good/successful\nleader? [Why/Why not?]\nTest 4 - Speaking - Part 2\nPlease answer the question\nDescribe a time when you had a long discussion about a news story.\nYou should say:\n\nwhat the news story was about\n\nwho you discussed this news story with\n\nwhat people's opinions were and explain why you had such a long\ndiscussion about this news story.\nTest 4 - Speaking - Part 3\nPlease answer the questions 1–6\n1. How do most people find out about the news in your country?\n2. Are people more interested in local news than national news?\n3. How important is it to know about international news?\n4. Why are discussion programmes involving members of the public\npopular on TV and radio?\n5. What kinds of people want to take part in discussion programmes?\n6. Do discussion programmes influence people in a good or bad way?\nAUDIOSCRIPTS\nTEST 1\n",
